## Data model (Prisma, grouped)

Catalog / content
- Product (category, price, specs JSON, stock, images, isQuoteOnly)
- ProductCategory
- Package (Basic / Recommended / Premium — inclusions, price range, items[])
- Solution (Home / Shops / Offices / Warehouses — slug, content, typical camera count, starting price)
- Project (before/after images, clientType, location, testimonial link)
- Testimonial
- BlogPost, Faq
- SeoMeta (per-route title/description/OG)

Leads & sales
- Lead (name, phone, email, area/address, propertyType, source, status, note)
- LeadStatus enum: NEW, CONTACTED, SURVEY_BOOKED, QUOTED, WON, LOST, INSTALLED
- LeadActivity (audit trail + follow-up scheduling)
- SurveyBooking (leadId, preferredDate/Time, technicianId, status)
- Technician (user + availability)
- Quote + QuoteItem (template-driven, PDF url, accept status)
- Customer (converted lead, portal identity)

Post-sale
- AmcContract (start, expiry, reminders, renewal link)
- Invoice, Payment (Payment unused in MVP)
- Ticket + TicketMessage (issue category, photo refs, ticket number, status)
- Notification (channel, template, payload, sent/read status)
- User (staff/customer) + Role (ADMIN, SALES, TECHNICIAN, CUSTOMER)

E-commerce (Phase 5)
- Order + OrderItem, Cart, Address

Neon usage: pooled DATABASE_URL for the app, direct DIRECT_URL for migrations.

