## Cross-cutting concerns

- AuthZ: role guards; customers use email+password.
- Security: helmet, CORS allowlist, Upstash rate limiting, Zod validation, presigned
  uploads only, secrets in env, never publish camera views or addresses.
- SEO: per-route SeoMeta, sitemap.xml, robots, JSON-LD (LocalBusiness + FAQ + Product).
- Performance: mobile-first, image optimization, route-level code splitting, Lighthouse budget.
- Privacy: privacy policy, form consent, PII handling.
- Observability: Sentry (web + api), structured logs, uptime check on the lead endpoint.
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions — lint, typecheck, unit, e2e, prisma migrate deploy (with DIRECT_URL), preview deploys.

