## Phased roadmap

| Phase | Scope | Weeks |
|---|---|---|
| 0 — Foundation | Monorepo, Tailwind tokens, Neon + Prisma wired, Nest serverless deploy on Vercel, CI (migrate in Actions), WhatsApp float, base layout | 1 |
