| 4 — Post-sale | Support tickets + R2 photo upload, FAQ/video deflection, AMC renewal reminders, review request | 11–12 |
| 5 — E-commerce + optimization | Checkout for non-quote-only items, A/B tests, SEO ramp, cost-per-lead reporting | 13+ |

