## Testing strategy

- Unit: Vitest (web), Jest (api) — calculator rules, quote math, status transitions.
- API e2e: Bruno collections under /bruno, run in CI (bru run) against a
  Neon branch database. Covers public lead capture, auth, admin pipeline, tickets.
- Frontend components: React Testing Library for forms + calculator.
- Full e2e: Playwright — book survey, add to quote, ticket submit, portal login.

Bruno environment files: local.bru, staging.bru, prod.bru (secrets kept out of VCS).

